### 测试认证API的HTTP请求文件
### 使用VS Code的REST Client扩展或其他HTTP客户端工具

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 测试API连通性
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/testauth/ping

### 2. 测试Redis缓存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/testauth/test-cache

### 3. 用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "hashedpassword123",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 4. 获取用户信息（需要先登录获取token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/userprofile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. 获取用户详细资料
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/userprofile/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. 更新用户资料
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/userprofile/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "displayName": "Alice Johnson Updated",
  "email": "alice.updated@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "1234567890"
}

### 7. 获取登录历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/userprofile/login-history?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. 获取活跃会话
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/userprofile/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. 修改密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "hashedpassword123",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123",
  "confirmPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 10. 刷新令牌
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 11. 验证会话
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. 忘记密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "alice_member"
}

### 13. 重置密码（需要从日志中获取重置令牌）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "{{resetToken}}",
  "newPassword": "resetpassword123",
  "confirmPassword": "resetpassword123"
}

### 14. 登出
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 15. 测试登录失败（错误密码）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "wrongpassword",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 16. 测试账户锁定（多次失败登录后）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "wrongpassword1",
  "rememberMe": false
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "wrongpassword2",
  "rememberMe": false
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "wrongpassword3",
  "rememberMe": false
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "wrongpassword4",
  "rememberMe": false
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "wrongpassword5",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 17. 测试锁定后的登录尝试
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_member",
  "password": "hashedpassword123",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 注意事项：
### 1. 请将 {{accessToken}} 替换为实际的访问令牌
### 2. 请将 {{refreshToken}} 替换为实际的刷新令牌
### 3. 请将 {{resetToken}} 替换为从日志中获取的重置令牌
### 4. 确保Redis服务器正在运行
### 5. 确保数据库中存在测试用户数据
